# The gateway prototype Dockerfile expects the OxFin directory as its context.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.code-index
**/.codeindexignore
**/*.log

# Private credentials and database sidecars are never build inputs.
**/*.db-*
**/*.db.enc*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.secrets
**/secrets
**/credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/serviceAccountKey*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/.streamlit/secrets.toml
